-- Farm (send pets buttons, hatch eggs, Pet Speed), Gamepasses (Fast hatch, Hoverboard, Teleport, Orb Magnet), Settings (hide key,
-- low device mode, hide pets / players, black screen, FPS cap).
-- Works on PC and phone. Everything only changes things on your side; the game sends its own requests.
-- K hides / shows the window (changeable in Settings).
